---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title:
description: 记录技术学习、开发实践与阶段性思考的中文个人技术博客。
---
<section class="home-hero{% if site.heroImage %} home-hero--image{% endif %}"{% if site.heroImage %} style="--hero-image: url('{{ site.heroImage }}')"{% endif %}>
  <div class="home-hero__grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="home-hero__orb home-hero__orb--one" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="shell home-hero__inner home-hero__inner--profile">
    <div class="home-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow">MUJIAN · NOTES & PRACTICE</p>
      <h1>{{ site.title }}</h1>
      <p class="home-hero__subtitle">{{ site.subtitle }}</p>
      <p class="home-hero__intro">从具体问题出发，梳理概念、实现路径与工程取舍。这里既是技术文章集，也是一个持续生长的个人知识库。</p>
      <ul class="focus-list" aria-label="主要关注方向">
        {% for area in site.focusAreas %}<li>{{ area }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <div class="home-hero__actions">
        <a class="button button--primary" href="#latest">阅读最新文章</a>
        <a class="button button--ghost" href="/topics/">浏览专题</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="home-profile-card" aria-label="博客概览">
      <p class="home-profile-card__label">BLOG SNAPSHOT</p>
      <dl class="home-stats">
        <div>
          <dt>文章</dt>
          <dd>{{ collections.posts | length }}</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>专题</dt>
          <dd>{{ site.topics | length }}</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>最近更新</dt>
          <dd>{% if collections.posts.length %}{{ collections.posts[0].date | dateDisplay }}{% else %}筹备中{% endif %}</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
      <div class="home-profile-card__line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <p>写作不是展示答案，而是保留理解问题的过程。</p>
      <a href="/about/">关于这个博客 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </aside>
  </div>
  <a class="scroll-cue" href="#latest" aria-label="向下阅读最新文章"><span>向下阅读</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
</section>

<section class="latest-section" id="latest">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">LATEST WRITING</p>
        <h2>最新文章</h2>
      </div>
      <p>从一个具体问题出发，逐层拆开概念、边界与工程取舍。文章会持续修订，而不是发布后即停止生长。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="article-list home-article-list">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
        {% include "partials/article-card.njk" %}
      {% else %}
        <div class="empty-state">
          <p>文章正在整理中。</p>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="section-action">
      <a class="text-link" href="/archive/">查看全部归档 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="topics-preview">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">KNOWLEDGE PATHS</p>
        <h2>持续整理的专题</h2>
      </div>
      <p>专题不是简单的标签集合，而是一条可逐步推进、反复回看的学习路径。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="topic-grid">
      {% for topic in site.topics %}
        <article class="topic-card">
          <div class="topic-card__top">
            <span>0{{ loop.index }}</span>
            <span>{{ topic.status }}</span>
          </div>
          <h3>{{ topic.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ topic.description }}</p>
          <a href="/tags/#{{ topic.tag }}">查看相关内容 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="section-action">
      <a class="text-link" href="/topics/">进入专题页面 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-note">
  <div class="shell home-note__inner home-note__inner--split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">BUILD · UNDERSTAND · WRITE</p>
      <blockquote>技术真正变得有用，往往发生在我们能解释它为何存在、解决什么问题，以及何时不该使用它之后。</blockquote>
    </div>
    <div class="home-note__aside">
      <p>这个博客会记录技术学习、开发实践，也会保留个人成长中的判断与变化。</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/about/">了解这个博客 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>